~ pursuit

$> story.set_flag("kestrel_pursuit_seen", true)

if story.flag("kestrel_captain_hidden")
	pirate_captain: You are the station that hid a man from the Patrol. That makes you interesting to us.
	pirate_captain: Interesting stations pay a retainer. Fifteen hundred, and we forget where you are.
else
	pirate_captain: The Kestrel went quiet somewhere near you and we would like to know where.
	pirate_captain: Fifteen hundred credits buys the question going away.

- Pay the retainer [if station.credits_held() >= 1500 /] [#blocked=You cannot raise 1500 credits]
	$> station.credits(-1500)
	$> story.shift_standing("pirates", 0.15)
	pirate_captain: Pleasure. Genuinely.
	=> END
- Tell them where to go
	$> story.shift_standing("pirates", -0.15)
	pirate_captain: We were hoping you would say that.
	$> station.raid(-1.0)
	=> END
- Report the contact to the Patrol [if story.flag("kestrel_captain_hidden") == false /] [#blocked=You have your own reasons not to call the Patrol]
	$> story.shift_standing("authority", 0.2)
	$> story.shift_standing("pirates", -0.2)
	patrol_officer: Logged. We cannot get a cutter to you before they do, but it will be on the record.
	$> station.raid(-1.0)
	=> END
